    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/764fc30668f68530a18f021ce5ba92f5.svg) ⟨28⟩\nKanisia⟨28⟩\n/\nhdf5-vds-file-read-modelscan-bypass⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨30⟩ Community ⟨31⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this model\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨32⟩ or Sign Up⟨33⟩ to review the conditions and access this model content.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨34⟩ for more information.\n  * HDF5 Virtual Dataset External File Read ModelScan Bypass⟨35⟩\n    * Files⟨36⟩\n    * Reproduction⟨37⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨35⟩ HDF5 Virtual Dataset External File Read ModelScan Bypass \nThis PoC shows that an HDF5 model file can contain a Virtual Dataset (VDS) mapping to a dataset in another HDF5 file.\nWhen the dataset in the main `.h5` file is read, HDF5 follows the VDS mapping and reads data from the external HDF5 source file. ModelScan 0.8.8 reports zero issues and skips the file as `MODEL_CONFIG not found`.\n##   ⟨36⟩ Files \n  * `hdf5_vds_file_read.h5` - main PoC HDF5 file containing the virtual dataset.\n  * `vds_source_secret.h5` - external HDF5 file read through the VDS mapping.\n  * `build_and_verify.py` - builds the PoC and verifies the behavior.\n  * `verify_report.json` - local verification output.\n\n\n##   ⟨37⟩ Reproduction \nRun:\n\n```\npython build_and_verify.py\n\n```\n\nExpected results:\n  * `verification.is_virtual=true`\n  * `verification.read_marker_ok=true`\n  * `modelscan.parsed.summary.total_issues=0`\n  * `modelscan.parsed.summary.skipped.total_skipped=1`\n\n\nThe marker read through the main HDF5 file is:\n\n```\nHDF5_VDS_FILE_READ_MARKER!!\n\n```\nDownloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨38⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨39⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨40⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨41⟩ Privacy⟨42⟩ About⟨43⟩ Careers⟨44⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
